sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User or Planner
    participant A as Kubernetes API
    participant C as DGD Controller
    participant P as Selected Program
    participant W as Child / Provider Controllers
    participant E as Event Recorder
    U->>A: Update desired state
    A-->>C: Watch event queues object key
    C->>A: Read latest desired/observed state
    C->>P: Reconcile complete DGD
    P->>A: Reconcile required workload resources
    A-->>W: Child resource changes
    P-->>C: Complete status + pending events + result/error
    C->>A: Status().Update
    alt Status write succeeds
        C->>E: Emit queued status-transition events
    else Status write fails
        C-->>C: Return error, do not emit queued events
    end
    W->>A: Update workload readiness/status
    A-->>C: New watch trigger
    Note over C,W: Reconcile duration is not model startup duration
